msgid "Allows transmission of data packets through the serial ports on the APM via MAVProxy (ie. remote control of the serial ports). Use ``serial lock`` and ``serial unlock`` to give (or release) exclusive control of the serial ports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/modules/serial.rst:14
#: be13ecf481ee4fce87bed45ba3ec2434
msgid "To change to serial port settings use ``serial set [setting] [value]``, where setting can be port, baudrate or timeout. To send data, enter ``serial send [data]``."
msgstr ""

